; ☆証拠品：『小さな鍵』入手
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:2-3
@UpdateWitchBook Id:2-3 Category:Clue Version:1
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true

